    title: ForestGeneralLines
    ---
    <<declare $fgNumber = 0>>
    <<set $fgNumber = random_range(0, 4)>>
    <<if $fgNumber == 0>>
    He's out there somewhere. #line:HesOut
    <<elseif $fgNumber == 1>>
    Don’t give in to fear. He needs me. #line:DontGive
    <<elseif $fgNumber == 2>>
    This fog… it’s not natural. It wants me to forget. #line:ThisFog
    <<elseif $fgNumber == 3>>
    Every step takes me closer… I have to believe that. #line:EveryStep
    <<else>>
    They won’t keep him from me. Not without a fight. #line:TheyWont
    <<endif>>
    ===
